\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Through the love of God our Saviour,
\par All will be well;
\par Free and changeless is His favour,
\par All, all is well:
\par Precious is the blood that healed us;
\par Perfect is the grace that sealed us;
\par Strong the hand stretched forth to shield us,
\par All must be well.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Though we pass through tribulation,
\par And will be well;
\par Christ hath purchased full salvation,
\par All, all is well:
\par Happy still in God confiding;
\par Fruitful, if in Christ abiding;
\par Holy, through the Spirit's guiding;
\par All must be well.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We expect a bright to-morrow;
\par All will be well;
\par Faith can sing through days of sorrow,
\par All, all is well:
\par On our Father's Love relying,
\par Jesus every need supplying,
\par Then in living or in dying
\par All must be well.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

